{"id":"level-up-2026-09-29","name":"2026-09-29 每日卡片","project":"level-up-cards","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/tree/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45","sentences":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s551","en":"The smell of fresh bread began to permeate the kitchen.","zh":"新鲜面包的香气开始弥漫整个厨房。","note":"permeate · 扩散， 弥漫； 渗透， 渗入 · permeate the air","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s552","en":"Her busy schedule leaves little time for long lunch breaks.","zh":"她忙碌的日程几乎没有留下长时间午休的空当。","note":"schedule · 安排；列入，收进；时刻表； 清单 · a busy schedule","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s553","en":"The survey recorded gradual deterioration in the abandoned building's roof.","zh":"勘察记录了废弃建筑屋顶逐渐损坏的情况。","note":"deterioration · 恶化； 堕落 · gradual deterioration","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s554","en":"We need more information to interpret these surprising results.","zh":"我们需要更多信息来解读这些令人意外的结果。","note":"interpret · 解释， 说明； 口译， 翻译 · interpret the results","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s555","en":"The planetarium show explores the scale of the observable universe.","zh":"天文馆的节目探索了可观测宇宙的规模。","note":"universe · 宇宙， 天地万物； 世界； 领域 · the observable universe","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s556","en":"She wrapped a warm blanket around her sleeping child.","zh":"她用一条暖和的毯子裹住熟睡的孩子。","note":"blanket · 毯子； 厚的覆盖物 · a warm blanket","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s557","en":"The team received a grant to study coastal erosion.","zh":"团队获得了一笔研究海岸侵蚀的资助。","note":"grant · 同意， 承认； 给予， 授予；授予物；补助金，助学金，津贴；授权 · a research grant","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s558","en":"The newsletter lists workshops and exhibitions happening next month.","zh":"这份通讯列出了下个月的工作坊和展览。","note":"newsletter · 时事通讯， 业务通讯 · a monthly newsletter","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s559","en":"The students tested whether each material was electrically conductive.","zh":"学生们测试了每种材料是否导电。","note":"conductive · 能传导电的， 导电的 · electrically conductive","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s560","en":"The bookshop offers a discount to students with valid identification.","zh":"书店为持有有效证件的学生提供折扣。","note":"discount · 折扣；给…打折； 漠视， 低估 · a student discount","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s561","en":"The children used recycled cardboard to construct a model bridge.","zh":"孩子们用回收纸板搭建了一座模型桥。","note":"construct · 建造；构思，构筑；创立['kɒnstrʌkt]；构想， 观念 · construct a model","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s562","en":"They hope to convert the empty warehouse into artists' studios.","zh":"他们希望把空仓库改成艺术家工作室。","note":"convert · 改变信仰， 皈依； 转变， 转化； 改装 · convert into","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s563","en":"Our first attempt to repair the old radio failed.","zh":"我们第一次修理这台旧收音机的尝试失败了。","note":"attempt · 尝试， 试图； 努力 · an initial attempt","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s564","en":"There is a clear division between the exhibition's two sections.","zh":"展览的两个部分之间有明确的分隔。","note":"division · 分开， 分隔； 分配； 分歧； 除； 部门， 科， 司 · a clear division","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s565","en":"The driver relied on satellite navigation to find the remote farm.","zh":"司机依靠卫星导航找到了那座偏远农场。","note":"navigation · 航空， 航海， 航行； 导航， 领航 · satellite navigation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s566","en":"We used the stale bread to make crunchy breadcrumbs.","zh":"我们用不新鲜的面包做了酥脆的面包屑。","note":"stale · 不新鲜的； 陈腐的 · stale bread","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s567","en":"She stretched out her arms to keep her balance.","zh":"她张开双臂来保持平衡。","note":"balance · 平衡；余额；平衡 · keep one's balance","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s568","en":"The photograph shows a fingerprint on the polished glass surface.","zh":"照片展示了抛光玻璃表面上的一枚指纹。","note":"fingerprint · 指纹， 手印 · a clear fingerprint","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s569","en":"The football pitch was too wet for Saturday's match.","zh":"足球场太湿了，无法举行周六的比赛。","note":"pitch · 投掷；颠簸；为…定音高；沥青； 场地； 程度； 最高点； 音高 · a football pitch","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s570","en":"My brother prefers busy cities, whereas I enjoy quiet villages.","zh":"弟弟更喜欢热闹的城市，而我喜欢安静的村庄。","note":"whereas · 然而， 但是 · whereas others","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s571","en":"Heavy rain turned the small stream into a roaring torrent.","zh":"大雨把小溪变成了咆哮的洪流。","note":"torrent · 洪流； 爆发； 连发 · a torrent of water","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s572","en":"The technician checked all electrical equipment before the event.","zh":"活动开始前，技术员检查了所有电气设备。","note":"electrical · 电的， 电学的， 有关电的 · electrical equipment","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s573","en":"A bronze statue of the poet stands outside the library.","zh":"图书馆外矗立着诗人的铜像。","note":"statue · 塑像 · a bronze statue","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s574","en":"She sells handmade soaps from a stall at the market.","zh":"她在市场的摊位上售卖手工香皂。","note":"stall · 货摊； 小隔间 · a market stall","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s575","en":"The library introduced a clearer classification system for children's books.","zh":"图书馆为儿童读物采用了更清楚的分类体系。","note":"classification · 分类； 级别 · a classification system","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s576","en":"Let the tea brew while we set the table.","zh":"让茶泡一会儿，我们来摆桌子。","note":"brew · 酿造； 冲泡； 酝酿 · brew tea","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s577","en":"He prepared a mild vegetable curry for the family dinner.","zh":"他为家庭晚餐做了一道不太辣的蔬菜咖喱。","note":"curry · 咖喱， · a vegetable curry","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s578","en":"The café serves excellent homemade food without any pretension.","zh":"这家咖啡馆供应美味的家常食物，毫不装腔作势。","note":"pretension · 声称， 自命； 自负， 自命不凡 · without pretension","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s579","en":"Residents described speeding traffic as a menace to children.","zh":"居民把超速车辆描述为对儿童的威胁。","note":"menace · 威胁；危险的人；威胁到， 危及 · a public menace","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s580","en":"The speaker tried to deflect attention from the missing figures.","zh":"发言人试图把注意力从缺失的数据上转移开。","note":"deflect · 偏斜， 转向 · deflect attention","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s581","en":"The play questions whether its apparently virtuous hero is honest.","zh":"这部剧质疑那位看似品德高尚的主人公是否诚实。","note":"virtuous · 有道德的， 品性好的， 品德高的； 自命清高的； 贞洁的 · a virtuous character","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s582","en":"The machine rejected my ticket because it was invalid.","zh":"机器拒收了我的票，因为它已经无效。","note":"invalid · 无效的，作废的；无可靠根据的，站不住脚的；有病的，伤残的['ɪnvælɪd]；病弱者， 残疾者 · an invalid ticket","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s583","en":"We need to synchronise our clocks before starting the experiment.","zh":"开始实验前，我们需要校准时钟，使时间一致。","note":"synchronise · 同步发生， 同速进行 · synchronise clocks","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s584","en":"Students raised legitimate concerns about the lack of study space.","zh":"学生们对学习空间不足提出了合理的担忧。","note":"legitimate · 合法的， 法定的； 正当的， 合情合理的；使合法 · a legitimate concern","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s585","en":"The buses leave at regular intervals throughout the afternoon.","zh":"公交车整个下午按固定间隔发车。","note":"interval · 间隔， 幕间休息； 间距 · at regular intervals","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s586","en":"The city's cosmopolitan character is reflected in its diverse restaurants.","zh":"这座城市的国际化特色体现在其多元的餐厅中。","note":"cosmopolitan · 世界性的，全球的；世界主义者； 四海为家者 · a cosmopolitan city","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s587","en":"The panel will evaluate each proposal against the same criteria.","zh":"评审组将根据同样的标准评估每项提案。","note":"evaluate · 评价， 估价 · evaluate a proposal","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s588","en":"The enlarged photograph reveals the tiny legs of a mite.","zh":"放大的照片展示了螨虫细小的腿。","note":"mite · 极小量； 螨虫 · a dust mite","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s589","en":"A sample drawn from one neighbourhood may skew the results.","zh":"从单个社区抽取样本可能使结果出现偏差。","note":"skew · 歪斜的；使偏；曲解 · skew the results","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s590","en":"You can check the status of your order online.","zh":"你可以在线查看订单状态。","note":"status · 地位； 身份； 状况 · check the status","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s591","en":"The lecture explored semantic differences between several closely related verbs.","zh":"讲座探讨了几个密切相关的动词之间的语义差别。","note":"semantic · 语义的 · semantic differences","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s592","en":"She was upset when the concert was cancelled unexpectedly.","zh":"音乐会意外取消时，她感到难过。","note":"upset · 心烦的； 不适的；使苦恼；搅乱；推翻，颠倒[ˌʌp's3t] · feel upset","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s593","en":"A red dot marks our current location on the map.","zh":"地图上一个红点标出了我们目前的位置。","note":"dot · 打点于； 散布于， 点缀；点，小圆点 · a red dot","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s594","en":"I had time only to skim the report before lunch.","zh":"午饭前，我只有时间浏览一下报告。","note":"skim · 撇去； 掠过， 擦过； 浏览， 略读 · skim a report","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s595","en":"She placed a colourful stamp on the birthday card's envelope.","zh":"她在生日卡的信封上贴了一枚彩色邮票。","note":"stamp · 跺，重踏；在…上盖； · a postage stamp","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s596","en":"I try not to skip breakfast on busy mornings.","zh":"即使早晨很忙，我也尽量不省掉早餐。","note":"skip · 跳， 蹦； 漏过； 逃学 · skip breakfast","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s597","en":"The charity uses local radio to disseminate information about workshops.","zh":"慈善机构利用当地电台传播工作坊信息。","note":"disseminate · 散布， 传播 · disseminate information","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s598","en":"The factory closure triggered an exodus of workers from the town.","zh":"工厂关闭引发了工人从镇上大批离开。","note":"exodus · 大批离去， 成群外出 · a mass exodus","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s599","en":"Please mention any dietary preferences when you book the meal.","zh":"预订餐食时，请说明任何饮食偏好。","note":"mention · 提及， 说起 · mention a detail","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:s600","en":"A narrow wooden bridge crosses the stream behind the cottage.","zh":"一座狭窄的木桥横跨小屋后方的溪流。","note":"stream · 流出；溪流；一股 · a mountain stream","recordings":[]}],"words":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:w551","en":"permeate","zh":"扩散， 弥漫； 渗透， 渗入","note":"英 /'pɜːmieɪt/ · 美 /'pɝmɪet/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0551-uk-71707e5804b5.mp3","text":"permeate"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0551-us-84928f46e51f.mp3","text":"permeate"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:w552","en":"schedule","zh":"安排；列入，收进；时刻表； 清单","note":"英 /'ʃedjuːəl/ · 美 /ˈskedʒʊl; skɛdʒʊl/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0552-uk-d0318f2a7d67.mp3","text":"schedule"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0552-us-cff92451260d.mp3","text":"schedule"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-29:w553","en":"deterioration","zh":"恶化； 堕落","note":"英 /dɪˌtɪərə'reɪʃn/ · 美 /dɪ,tɪrɪə'reʃən/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0553-uk-7c21ee88ab0b.mp3","text":"deterioration"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0553-us-1a